Rule 1 (input tensor x must have an integer dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5
>>
Rule 3 (input tensor must have an explicit integer dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor must have an integer dtype and non-empty shape)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (unsigned integer tensors must have non-negative values and signed integer tensors must have valid integer dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 5 then min(v_1) ≥ 0 else 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 4
>>
Rule 6 (input tensor has valid rank and strictly integer dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) > 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) < 6
>>
Rule 7 (at least 1-dimensional tensor with integer dtype and non-empty leading dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0
